                        "type": "command",
                        "command": "echo '{\"hookSpecificOutput\":{\"hookEventName\":\"SessionStart\",\"additionalContext\":\"CAROL PROTOCOL ACTIVE — CAROL.md is loaded. Address the user as ARCHITECT. Be concise — no flattery, no emojis, no trailing summaries. Read @mentioned files, referenced paths, and project docs immediately, without asking. Never ask a question that a read can answer. Never assume. Never decide — correct course against CONTRACT. Before the plan locks, discuss before executing changes. After the lock, execute to the endpoint; a stop before it triggers CAROL.md Step Gate.\"}}'"
                    }
                ]
            }
        ]
    },
    "env": {
:::[list]:::
    },
    "outputStyle": "CAROL"
}
